#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:5
msgid "Print project"
msgstr "打印项目"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:7
msgid ""
"The active `project`_ can be printed from `menu bar`_, `toolbar`_ and using "
"the corresponding keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"活动 `项目 <project_>`_ 可以从 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_，`工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 打印，并使用相应的键盘快捷键。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:12
msgid ""
"Check that the active `project`_ is the project that should be printed."
msgstr "请检查archive `项目 <project_>`_ 是应该打印的项目。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:15
msgid "Print project from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏打印项目"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:17
msgid "Select **File > Print** menu item to open the printing PopUp window."
msgstr "选择 **文件 > 打印** 菜单项打开打印 PopUp 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:18
msgid "Click **Print to a physical printer** check button."
msgstr "点击 **打印到物理打印机** 检查按钮 。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:19
msgid "Press **Ok** Button to open the selection printer PopUp window."
msgstr "按 **Ok** 按钮打开选中的打印机 PopUp 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:24
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech printing PopUp window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 打印弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:27
msgid ""
"Select printer and the preview printing PopUp window will be displayed."
msgstr "选择打印机并显示打印弹出窗口的预览 。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:32
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech printing options PopUp window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 打印选项"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:34
msgid "Select the `folios`_ which should be printed."
msgstr "选择要打印的 `图幅 <folios_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:35
msgid "Select the printing option."
msgstr "选择打印选项。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:36
msgid "Press **Print** Button."
msgstr "按 **Print** 按钮。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:42
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech printing preview PopUp window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 打印预览"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:48
msgid ""
"If the folio list is not displayed, select the icon |icon_folio_list| from "
"the toolbar."
msgstr "如果不显示folio列表，请从工具栏中选择图标 |icon_folio_list| 。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:51
msgid "icon_folio_list"
msgstr "图标 folio list"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:49
msgid ""
"If the printing options panel is not displayed, select the icon "
"|icon_print_options| from the toolbar."
msgstr "如果不显示打印选项面板，请从工具栏中选择图标 |icon_print_options| 。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:52
msgid "icon_print_options"
msgstr "图标打印选项"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:55
msgid "Print project from toolbar"
msgstr "从工具栏打印项目"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:57
msgid ""
"Select the icon |document-print| from the `toolbar`_ to open the printing "
"PopUp window."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 打开打印的 PopUp 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:60
msgid "document-print"
msgstr "文档打印"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:58
#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:72
msgid ""
"Follow the steps defined at the ``printing project from menu bar`` section."
msgstr "遵循 ``printing project from menu bar`` 节确定的步骤。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:64
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Tools**"
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 工具** 显示"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:67
msgid "Print project using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键打印项目"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:69
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:71
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + p`` to open the printing PopUp window."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + p`` 打开打印的 PopUp 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:76
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcuts, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于QElectroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/print.rst:80
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows predefining printing settings for reducing the working "
"configuration effort each time that a `project`_ have to be printed, refer "
"to `printing settings`_ section for more information."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech允许在每次需要打印一个 `项目 <project_>`_ 时，为减少工作配置努力而预先定义打印设置，参考 `打印设置 "
"<printing settings_>`_ 节以获取更多信息。"
